dding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B8%A9%E5%A6%AE%E5%BC%97%E9%9B%B7%E5%BE%B7\" title=\"温妮弗雷德\"><img alt=\"温妮弗雷德\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B8%A9%E5%A6%AE%E5%BC%97%E9%9B%B7%E5%BE%B7\" title=\"温妮弗雷德\">温妮弗雷德</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>1.8</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>银行</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>构成理念</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：305103</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">技能1</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">技能2</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3051/305103/技能1.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3051/305103/技能1 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3051/305103/技能2.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3051/305103/技能2 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3051/305103/大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3051/305103/大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3051/305103/入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3051/305103/入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">伟大的科考航船即将前往北极考察！<br />这个消息以前所未有的速度传遍了世界的所有角落。人们渴望从这次航程中了解些新东西，譬如极地的生态、因纽特人的文化、古老的传说与奇迹。<br />就连神秘学界名流温妮弗雷德都愿登上这艘勇敢的破冰船，前往极地一探究竟。梦想与浪漫，正是极地的美妙所在。在她眼中，那里是一望无尽的未知，其中也许蕴藏着莫大财富。一切险境都是机遇，她如此相信着，甚至不惜在此项目上进行了一笔至关重要的投资。<br />当然，对她来说，前往北极不仅是一次探险，也是一种度假。对长生的神秘学家来说，没有比新奇体验更重要的东西了。<br />她永远都在路上，为商机，也为了更多的新东西。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"305103\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-305104.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/30/Belonging-305104.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\"><div class=\"line-1\">“原型风尚”\n</div><div class=\"line-2\">经典库班帽</div><div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Classic Couture\" Kubanka</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />75<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>受访者在登上邮轮前购置的冬帽。在华丽保暖的经典样式上，设计师以精巧的珠饰为点缀，使其即使在北极圈的凛冽寒风中，也能闪亮而持久地吸引诸多目光。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-305105.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/c7/Belonging-305105.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“启明星”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Morning Star\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />350<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>以航海罗盘为设计灵感的珠宝项链，由众多宝石连缀而成，在极光下尤为闪耀。据传，这串项链中的其余宝石均为天然产出的昂贵珍品，当中的主石却是一枚普通的菲安尼特合成石。值得一提的是，受访者并未对这一说法作出任何回应。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-305106.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/2a/Belonging-305106.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“开拓纪念”肩背包<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Pioneering\" Sling Bag</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>Eurybia品牌的最新款背包，在经典设计基础上，加入了富有季节气息的皮毛元素。受访者本人参与了它的部分设计。“不过是分享了一些有趣的海上见闻罢了。”她如此说。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%9E%81%E5%9C%B0%E8%BF%9C%E6%9C%9B1.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 极地远望1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%9E%81%E5%9C%B0%E8%BF%9C%E6%9C%9B1.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%9E%81%E5%9C%B0%E8%BF%9C%E6%9C%9B1.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%9E%81%E5%9C%B0%E8%BF%9C%E6%9C%9B1.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%9E%81%E5%9C%B0%E8%BF%9C%E6%9C%9B1.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%9E%81%E5%9C%B0%E8%BF%9C%E6%9C%9B1.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%9E%81%E5%9C%B0%E8%BF%9C%E6%9C%9B1.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%9E%81%E5%9C%B0%E8%BF%9C%E6%9C%9B2.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 极地远望2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%9E%81%E5%9C%B0%E8%BF%9C%E6%9C%9B2.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%9E%81%E5%9C%B0%E8%BF%9C%E6%9C%9B2.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%9E%81%E5%9C%B0%E8%BF%9C%E6%9C%9B2.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%9E%81%E5%9C%B0%E8%BF%9C%E6%9C%9B2.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%9E%81%E5%9C%B0%E8%BF%9C%E6%9C%9B2.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%9E%81%E5%9C%B0%E8%BF%9C%E6%9C%9B2.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">极地远望 <small style=\"color: grey\">A Visit to the Arctic</small></span></span>"}}